  "ingredients": [
    "1 (10 ounce) can refrigerated biscuit dough",
    "4 thick slices bacon",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup milk, or as needed",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I_f7dYdYOHk5RiR0RkRD3j-486Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-1a-60fe90d91a37417eb7bef36621e30023.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Place biscuits in an ungreased baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yUctIYsyWXOMwGKCMOphdAarHBs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-1-e547c075c2b24750af33c19a10aef667.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 10 to 13 minutes or as directed on the package instructions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sk3kSpja8RH-1M8nZhYL0BRennA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-2-bbc4db2e327f4f48ba51185991ef1da4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the biscuits are baking, cook bacon in a deep skillet over medium heat until crisp, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dT2yoHGHjgPlzvtb-KE4Ps2pkA0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-3-7655ec9b4f8f4dc88dcceb18a8ce1530.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer bacon to a paper towel-lined plate, reserving bacon grease in the skillet. Whisk flour into bacon grease until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TT88nCtzP8FJYN9wlwIcao7rOhA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-4-bc97d38919df469e873b50d0ffdf8ca3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add milk and continue to stir over medium heat until thickened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Bc8SPekxiWJSB1lTdyUXKncqSjE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-5-a97fee8916284e3da9aa39c22b84a2e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crumble bacon into gravy and season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B1JyIora-oRdThsLHufMUHmE7Z8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-6-ae28ee8380d84864be6373ffca884f8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161819/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Split biscuits in half and top with gravy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ofxejteSnMVCFplr8DShp9M1lNY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161819-Bacon-Gravy-Biscuits-Step-7-3d4ae8c351c94065b710e35462a46c69.jpg"
